    "Use Zoro & Sogeking to neutralize Linlin or another threat that meets its Cost condition.",
    "Prioritize Leader attacks when your Characters are needed for defense.",
    "Use Double Attack to force Counters even if you cannot finish the game immediately."
  ], after: [
    "Two 9000-Power Double Attack swings will force Rocks to spend many cards from hand. This repeated pressure is especially useful after your opponent has already used some of their Counters.",
