<MainLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="hero guide-hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-tags"><span class="hero-chip">Deck Guide</span><span class="hero-chip hero-chip-accent">OP18 Format</span></div><h1>Monkey D. Luffy OP18 Deck Guide</h1><p class="hero-intro">Your priority is to find OP18-031 Nico Robin while keeping a hand that can develop your board and prepare your first offensive turns.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#curve">Game Plan &amp; Curve</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#matchups">Matchups</a><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-card-list" href="/cards-list/OP18/">Card List OP18</a></div></div><div class="guide-icon"><img src={guideIcon} alt="Monkey D. Luffy OP18 deck guide icon" loading="eager" /></div></div></section>
  <div class="container article-stack">
    <section id="decklist" class="glow-block"><div class="decklist-title-row"><h2>Decklist</h2><button class="btn btn-primary copy-sim-button" type="button" data-copy-sim={simDeckCode}>Copy for Sim</button></div><div class="deck-grid">{decklist.map((entry) => <button class="deck-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/><div class="deck-info"><b class="deck-count">{entry.count}x</b><span>{entry.name}<small class="deck-code">{entry.code}</small><small class="deck-role">{entry.role}</small></span></div></button>)}</div></section>
    <section id="mulligan" class="glow-block"><h2>Mulligan</h2>{mulliganIntro.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}<h3>Priority Cards</h3><div class="content-list">{mulligan.map((item) => <article class={`content-item has-cards ${item.cards.length > 1 ? "multiple-cards" : ""} ${item.titleAboveCards ? "title-above-cards" : ""} ${item.textBesideCards ? "text-beside-cards" : ""}`}><h3>{item.title}</h3><div class="card-row">{item.cards.map((entry) => <button class="mini-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/></button>)}</div><div class="paragraphs">{item.paragraphs.map((text) => <p>{renderText(text).map((part) => part.startsWith("**") && part.endsWith("**") ? <strong>{part.slice(2,-2)}</strong> : part)}</p>)}</div></article>)}</div><h3>When to Mulligan?</h3>{mulliganGuidelines.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}</section>
    <section id="curve" class="glow-block">
      <h2>Game Plan &amp; Curve</h2>
      <p>Green Luffy balances offensive pressure with defense. Your goal is to deal as much damage to your opponent as possible while limiting the damage you take in return.</p>
      <p>With 3 or more DON!! attached, your Leader can set itself Active when it attacks, once per turn. In return, it cannot become Active during your next Refresh Phase.</p>
      <p>After using your Leader's re-stand effect, you can choose to keep it Active or make a second attack before setting it Active again with another card's effect.</p>
      <p>Going second is preferable because it lets you play Nico Robin at 4 DON!! and Zoro &amp; Sogeking at 6 DON!!.</p>
      {[['Going First', curveFirst], ['Going Second', curveSecond]].map(([heading, curve]) => <div class="curve-block">
        <h3>{heading}</h3>
        {curve.map((item) => <article class="curve-item">
          <strong>{item.title}</strong>
          <div class="curve-content">
            <div class={`card-set ${item.cards.length === 1 ? 'one' : ''} ${item.cards.length === 2 ? 'two' : ''} ${item.cards.length === 4 ? 'four' : ''} ${item.cards.length === 3 ? 'three' : ''} ${item.connectors?.length ? 'connected' : ''}`}>
              {item.cards.map((entry, index) => <>{index > 0 && item.connectors?.[index - 1] && <span class="connector">{item.connectors[index - 1]}</span>}<button class="mini-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/></button></>)}
            </div>
            <div class="curve-note">{item.paragraphs?.map((text) => <p>{renderText(text).map((part) => part.startsWith('**') && part.endsWith('**') ? <strong>{part.slice(2,-2)}</strong> : part)}</p>)}{item.bullets && <ul>{item.bullets.map((text) => <li>{renderText(text).map((part) => part.startsWith('**') && part.endsWith('**') ? <strong>{part.slice(2,-2)}</strong> : part)}</li>)}</ul>}{item.after?.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}</div>
          </div>
        </article>)}
      </div>)}
    </section>
    <section id="tech-cards" class="glow-block"><h2>Tech Cards</h2><p>In addition to its Water Seven core, Green Luffy has several cards that strengthen its defense, complete its curve, and help set up lethal attacks.</p><div class="content-list">{techCards.map((item) => <>{item.optionalStart && <><h3>Other Possible Tech Cards</h3><p>These cards are not in this decklist, but they are options for changing your strategy or adapting the deck to the meta.</p></>}<article class={`tech-card ${item.cards.length > 1 ? "multiple-tech-cards" : ""}`}><div class="tech-card-images">{item.cards.map((entry) => <button class="mini-card tech-card-image" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/></button>)}</div><h3>{item.title}</h3><div class="paragraphs">{item.paragraphs.map((text) => <p>{renderText(text).map((part) => part.startsWith("**") && part.endsWith("**") ? <strong>{part.slice(2,-2)}</strong> : part)}</p>)}{item.bullets && <ul>{item.bullets.map((text) => <li>{text}</li>)}</ul>}{item.after?.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}</div></article></>)}</div></section>
    <section id="matchups" class="glow-block"><h2>Matchup Analysis</h2>{matchupIntro.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}<div class="content-list">{matchups.map((item) => <article class="content-item matchup-card"><div class="matchup-heading"><button class="mini-card matchup-leader-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={`${item.leader.img}`} data-name={`${item.leader.code} ${item.leader.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(item.leader.img)} alt={`${item.leader.code} ${item.leader.name} Leader`} loading="lazy"/></button><div class="matchup-title-stack"><h3>{item.title}</h3>{item.rating && <span class={`matchup-rating-badge rating-${item.ratingTone}`}>{item.rating}</span>}</div></div><div class="matchup-body">{item.intro?.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}{item.gamePlan?.length > 0 && <><h4>Game Plan</h4><ul>{item.gamePlan.map((text) => <li>{text}</li>)}</ul></>}{item.after?.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}</div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section id="matchup-ratings" class="glow-block matchup-overview"><div class="section-header"><div><h2>Matchups</h2><p>Quick OP18 matchup spread for Monkey D. Luffy.</p></div></div><div class="matchup-overview-grid">{matchupSummaryGroups.map((group) => <div class="matchup-overview-group"><div class={`matchup-overview-badge overview-badge-${group.tone}`}><span class="matchup-overview-icon">{group.icon}</span><span>{group.label}</span></div><div class="matchup-overview-list">{group.cards.map((entry) => <button class="matchup-overview-entry" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} data-code={entry.code} aria-label={`${entry.name} Leader`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(matchupSummaryIcons[entry.code] ?? entry.img)} alt={`${entry.name} Leader`} loading="lazy"/></button>)}</div></div>)}</div><h3>Green Luffy's Position in the OP18 Meta</h3>{matchupPositioning.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}</section>
    <section id="tips" class="glow-block"><h2>Tips</h2><div class="content-list">{tips.map((item) => <article class="tip-card"><h3>{item.title}</h3><div class="tip-card-images">{item.cards.map((entry) => <button class="mini-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/></button>)}</div><div class="tip-copy">{item.paragraphs.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}{item.bullets && <ul>{item.bullets.map((text) => <li>{text}</li>)}</ul>}{item.after?.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}</div></article>)}</div></section>
  </div>
  <div class="card-modal" data-modal aria-hidden="true"><div class="card-modal-inner" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Card preview"><button class="modal-close" type="button" data-close>Close</button><img src="" alt="" data-modal-image/></div></div>
</MainLayout>

<script>
  const modal = document.querySelector("[data-modal]"); const modalImage = document.querySelector("[data-modal-image]");
  const closeModal = () => { modal?.classList.remove("is-open"); modal?.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true"); document.body.style.overflow = ""; };
  document.querySelectorAll("[data-card-preview]").forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", () => { if (!modal || !modalImage) return; modalImage.src = button.dataset.full || ""; modalImage.alt = button.dataset.name || "Card preview"; modal.classList.add("is-open"); modal.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "false"); document.body.style.overflow = "hidden"; }));
  document.querySelector("[data-close]")?.addEventListener("click", closeModal); modal?.addEventListener("click", (event) => { if (event.target === modal) closeModal(); });
  document.querySelector("[data-copy-sim]")?.addEventListener("click", async (event) => { const button = event.currentTarget; try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(button.dataset.copySim); const previous = button.textContent; button.textContent = "Copied"; window.setTimeout(() => { button.textContent = previous; }, 1800); } catch { button.textContent = "Copy failed"; } });
